<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cen bank one-wk repo average yield 56.63 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cen bank one-wk repo average yield 56.63 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield in Wednesday's Czech National Bank (CNB) one week, May 23 to May 30, repo tender reached 56.63 percent, the CNB said.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the maximum yield in the tender reached 70.00 percent, and that all bids at that level were accepted.</p>
